{
    "title": "Balloon Pop Kids Learning Game",
    "description": "Watch your toddler learn the <b>alphabet, numbers, animals, colors, shapes and more</b> playing Balloon Pop, the fun balloon popping baby game for kids aged 2-5. \r\n\r\nBalloon Pop is the ultimate <b>balloon popping game for kids</b>, boasting 9 creative scenes, each with different challenges. Support and encourage your toddler to learn their <b>ABCs, numbers, colors, shapes and even animal names</b> in a <b>100% ad free</b>, safe environment. \r\n\r\nHow does the game work?\r\n \r\n\u25baYour child chooses a world from 9 different balloon popping options \u2013 from farm and jungle, to Arctic, underwater and even Dino World\r\n\u25baChoose a category - alphabet, numbers, shapes or colors\r\n\u25baStart popping balloons for the learning to begin\r\n\r\nWhat can my 2,3,4 or even 5 year old learn playing Balloon Pop Kids Learning Game? \r\n\r\n\u25ba The English alphabet \r\n\u25ba Numbers 0-9  \r\n\u25ba Colors and phonics\r\n\u25ba Shapes such as squares, triangles and circles\r\n\u25ba Animal names \r\n\u25ba Dexterity and fine motor skills \r\n\r\nBalloon Pop Kids Learning Game is interactive, educational and fun, while the app\u2019s intuitive interface and simple gameplay allows kids to play independently without adult supervision.\r\n\r\nWhy Balloon Pop Kids Learning Game? \r\n\u25ba Play 36 balloon popping learning games that provide a safe device experience for 2-5 year old kids\r\n\u25ba Developed and tested by child development and baby game experts\r\n\u25ba Designed for safety and convenience with no supervision required\r\n\u25ba Parental Gate - code protected sections so that your child doesn\u2019t accidentally change settings or make unwanted purchases\r\n\u25ba All settings and outbound links are protected and only accessible for adults\r\n\u25ba Available offline and playable without an internet connection\r\n\u25ba Timely hints so your child doesn't feel frustrated or lost in the app\r\n\u25ba 100 % Ad free with no annoying interruptions\r\n\r\nWho says learning can't be fun? \r\nPlease support us by writing reviews if you like the app or let us know about any issue or suggestions too.\r\n\r\nBalloon Pop Kids Learning Game is completely free and without any ads.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Watch your toddler learn the <b>alphabet, numbers, animals, colors, shapes and more</b> playing Balloon Pop, the fun balloon popping baby game for kids aged 2-5. <br><br>Balloon Pop is the ultimate <b>balloon popping game for kids</b>, boasting 9 creative scenes, each with different challenges. Support and encourage your toddler to learn their <b>ABCs, numbers, colors, shapes and even animal names</b> in a <b>100% ad free</b>, safe environment. <br><br>How does the game work?<br> <br>\u25baYour child chooses a world from 9 different balloon popping options \u2013 from farm and jungle, to Arctic, underwater and even Dino World<br>\u25baChoose a category - alphabet, numbers, shapes or colors<br>\u25baStart popping balloons for the learning to begin<br><br>What can my 2,3,4 or even 5 year old learn playing Balloon Pop Kids Learning Game? <br><br>\u25ba The English alphabet <br>\u25ba Numbers 0-9  <br>\u25ba Colors and phonics<br>\u25ba Shapes such as squares, triangles and circles<br>\u25ba Animal names <br>\u25ba Dexterity and fine motor skills <br><br>Balloon Pop Kids Learning Game is interactive, educational and fun, while the app\u2019s intuitive interface and simple gameplay allows kids to play independently without adult supervision.<br><br>Why Balloon Pop Kids Learning Game? <br>\u25ba Play 36 balloon popping learning games that provide a safe device experience for 2-5 year old kids<br>\u25ba Developed and tested by child development and baby game experts<br>\u25ba Designed for safety and convenience with no supervision required<br>\u25ba Parental Gate - code protected sections so that your child doesn\u2019t accidentally change settings or make unwanted purchases<br>\u25ba All settings and outbound links are protected and only accessible for adults<br>\u25ba Available offline and playable without an internet connection<br>\u25ba Timely hints so your child doesn&#39;t feel frustrated or lost in the app<br>\u25ba 100 % Ad free with no anno